{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129980/extras/b95a9eed8dce53271ee0cdfb05dc5ccb.poster.avif?t=1762415630\" width=774 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129980/extras/b95a9eed8dce53271ee0cdfb05dc5ccb.webm?t=1762415630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129980/extras/b95a9eed8dce53271ee0cdfb05dc5ccb.mp4?t=1762415630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Gnome Glade</strong> is a <strong>cozy puzzle city-builder</strong> where you will create a gnome settlement by growing mushrooms and building your deck of cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the gnomes build their colony in a magical forest. This is a relaxing game where you can build at your own pace. Looking for a challenge? A hard mode is there for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>How does the gameplay work?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129980/extras/11c2aff0bfe17de6d79b679ab6958c88.poster.avif?t=1762415630\" width=872 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129980/extras/11c2aff0bfe17de6d79b679ab6958c88.webm?t=1762415630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129980/extras/11c2aff0bfe17de6d79b679ab6958c88.mp4?t=1762415630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with <strong>cards</strong>. Play a card to <strong>grow a mushroom</strong> that gives you <strong>stars</strong>. Stars are the main <strong>resource</strong> you use to get new cards. You can also <strong>merge</strong> mushrooms together to create better buildings that give you more stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main goal is to build the <strong>Golden Gnome Statue!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy city-building puzzle</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mushroom merge and synergy mechanics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards and simple deckbuilding</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard mode for a challenge</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warm forest atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What the game does not have:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4X and battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fairies or leprechauns (sorry, but it's a world of gnomes!)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129980/extras/02f8909f71039b02200a467881df5cdc.poster.avif?t=1762415630\" width=872 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129980/extras/02f8909f71039b02200a467881df5cdc.webm?t=1762415630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129980/extras/02f8909f71039b02200a467881df5cdc.mp4?t=1762415630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4129980?t=1762415630","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4129980?t=1762